OL,3,GNEWSAFunding set to double for plan to
OL,4,Aget rough sleepers off streets by
OL,5,AChristmas
OL,6,
OL,7,FFunding is set to double to support a
OL,8,Fpledge by the prime minister to give
OL,9,Fevery rough sleeper in England a route
OL,10,Foff the streets by Christmas.
OL,12,FEnding rough sleeping was one of Andy
OL,13,FBurnham's first promises when he
OL,14,Fentered Downing Street, announcing a
OL,15,F#442m package to provide emergency
OL,16,Faccommodation and practical support.
OL,18,FAhead of the first Rough Sleeping
OL,19,FSummit at Downing Street on Monday, No
OL,20,F10 has indicated a further #432m will
OL,21,Fbe added to the initiative in
OL,22,FWednesday's Budget.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
