OL,3,GNEWSAFunding set to double for plan to
OL,4,Aget rough sleepers off streets by
OL,5,AChristmas
OL,6,
OL,7,FShadow housing secretary Katie Lam said
OL,8,Frough sleeping had hit "record highs
OL,9,Funder Labour" and criticised Burnham
OL,10,Ffor failing to end rough sleeping when
OL,11,Fhe was the Mayor of Greater Manchester.
